      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为我听说过，烛光灵会\n吸取人的生命来恢复活力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
